{"4043610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Survival Menu Live ", "steam_appid": 4043610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Menu Live</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/cdc82623572de59b38cf1a582d5dc7c9.avif?t=1767125343\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Menu Live</strong> is a cooperative survival game focused on cooking under pressure. <br>Players explore the area to find food crates, place ingredients into cooking pots, wait for them to cook, and serve the food while dealing with constant danger and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is essential — gathering food, cooking, serving, and surviving all require coordination. Every decision can affect the team’s success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game emphasizes pressure, cooperation, and unpredictable moments that make each mission feel tense and chaotic in a fun way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food boxes scattered around the area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the food into a cooking pot and wait until it’s cooked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab an empty plate and scoop food from the pot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the food at the serving station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UV Light System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/165431645460cf1d1960580f0b5870a4.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/165431645460cf1d1960580f0b5870a4.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/165431645460cf1d1960580f0b5870a4.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UV Light Pillars can be activated to turn on protective lights that keep monsters away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must interact with the pillar and pay a small amount of money to activate the UV light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once activated, the surrounding area becomes safer for a limited time.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Donation Pillar </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/b5330d9749c7ca414678bf6d45bd968a.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/b5330d9749c7ca414678bf6d45bd968a.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/b5330d9749c7ca414678bf6d45bd968a.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Donation Pillars allow players to earn extra money in a risky way.<br>Activate the camera and dance in front of the pillar until the music ends.<br>If you finish the performance, you’ll receive a small cash reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/d75092e6960b1b769ee1b7ec95829f91.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/d75092e6960b1b769ee1b7ec95829f91.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/d75092e6960b1b769ee1b7ec95829f91.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Exit Door System </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main objective of each mission is to escape the area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must earn money by cooking and serving food. Every dish served adds to the team’s shared funds. This money is not only used for upgrades — it is required to unlock the exit gate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win the mission, the team must collect enough money and pay the exit gate fee to open it and escape.<br>You can earn exactly what’s needed — or take risks, stay longer, and earn extra money before leaving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you stay, the more dangerous the area becomes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE  SKILL  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/cb6c6fef0f848f8e89a3cba5b958b461.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/cb6c6fef0f848f8e89a3cba5b958b461.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/cb6c6fef0f848f8e89a3cba5b958b461.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your hard-earned cash to open new areas, buy survival tools like UV lights or baseball bats, and upgrade your cooking equipment. <br>After each round, upgrade your profession to fit your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chef:</strong> Cook faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Server:</strong> Move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manager:</strong> Earn more money per dish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taster:</strong> Sense ingredients nearby</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters — will you play safe and steady, or risk everything for a bigger reward? <br>Welcome to <i>Survival Menu Live</i> — where cooking and chaos are served hot.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Menu Live</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/cdc82623572de59b38cf1a582d5dc7c9.avif?t=1767125343\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/aebe3df171e6d315f70249842270c425.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Menu Live</strong> is a cooperative survival game focused on cooking under pressure. <br>Players explore the area to find food crates, place ingredients into cooking pots, wait for them to cook, and serve the food while dealing with constant danger and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is essential — gathering food, cooking, serving, and surviving all require coordination. Every decision can affect the team’s success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game emphasizes pressure, cooperation, and unpredictable moments that make each mission feel tense and chaotic in a fun way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/66478071af4c1ca4271c9f87fb74ed2d.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.poster.avif?t=1767125343\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.webm?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/extras/e39e14a883cc2faf41e1ecb60a466360.mp4?t=1767125343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find food boxes scattered around the area.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the food into a cooking pot and wait until it’s cooked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab an empty plate and scoop food from the pot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve the food at the serving station.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UV Light System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a