ooking equipment. <br>After each round, upgrade your profession to fit your playstyle:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chef:</strong> Cook faster</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Server:</strong> Move quicker</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manager:</strong> Earn more money per dish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Taster:</strong> Sense ingredients nearby</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters — will you play safe and steady, or risk everything for a bigger reward? <br>Welcome to <i>Survival Menu Live</i> — where cooking and chaos are served hot.</p>", "short_description": "A chaotic Co-op survival cooking game! Team up with friends to gather ingredients, cook, serve dishes, survive monsters, and upgrade your gear to keep your deadly kitchen alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/7c54884867c0ce483d671cdac966d09b74b6c271/header.jpg?t=1767125343", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/4b2912d764119e5bee2ae0c0b09a3e8fe4595b9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767125343", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043610/4b2912d764119e5bee2ae0c0b09a3e8fe4595b9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767125343", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows  10  - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available